{
  "format": "story-pages-v1",
  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-painting-class-v2-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "7684b35648ce28aa5bf3cd47811b45e98080b6d24a52fe8c2983c4358ee7079d",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "174d857c975e2cc0baee7e44b43e4d83f099d3312172d1e0fa425da65ab0647d",
      "text": "悟空的\n画画课",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cdc4d4f8a22a361bfc56e33eb0898ae16942ccedb54f21654e2aa78431d0ffc7",
      "text": "老师摆好纸和颜料。\n“今天，你们想画什么？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f101b979024117406aa45003a9d9588cebd6fc28e5444cb4e8ee21b4cde6c099",
      "text": "哪吒拿起画笔。\n“我要画独角兽，\n头发要像彩虹一样！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "60e2a5c6485b8d6878cfd243d6f9aa056054b1d7d81385b3208432e3a3a9275b",
      "text": "“我画小兔子！”八戒说。\n“瞧，这两只长耳朵！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7db3432b24ea080ee6728331a0dd4f04c02a377b4f03cba0972fb63ce00856ca",
      "text": "悟空一听，眼睛亮了。\n“我也想画独角兽！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4c0c7f685b9124d5c759a67366108dfb88db780b1293960247b066b1b6f487b1",
      "text": "把红色、蓝色搅一搅，\n再添一点黄色。\n搅呀搅，变成棕色啦。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bfced46bc4ca1762a65f762950f612b098537a92ebe3a0ddcdf834489b0cb700",
      "text": "悟空低头一看，\n纸上只有一团棕色颜料。\n“我的独角兽呢？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "19ac6badc2efa598b7e5139eea275ac464bd582c17b45bc82d8f25463018b675",
      "text": "老师走过来，弯下腰。\n“你再瞧瞧，\n这团颜料像什么？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e672e77f6e26d7f4901a57ef36bbbcb2449ba6229382a26fa4bc42b09b6207cd",
      "text": "悟空想了想，\n添上两只圆耳朵。\n“有啦！是一只小熊！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bf46d2eee1b2ae90d2401d2d5e05085cde488e1bb655711728c1b1b6a25da0e6",
      "text": "两只眼睛，一个鼻子。\n再把小嘴画得弯弯的。\n“小熊笑啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "093ed13616c3298ac47c6ff6da3aca432e7bd829af2f45cd37eabf582935e0e8",
      "text": "哪吒画上彩虹头发。\n八戒把兔耳朵里面\n涂得粉粉的。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b91500c313908ec49f96ceeb2bab238488da7cef05700c273288a797841ccbb8",
      "text": "悟空问：“能一起画吗？”\n“好呀！”\n两个小伙伴都点了头。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "16e3c9ab7c532ef5044350be6163107d789fea2367e89e0c738bdfb2b565b991",
      "text": "三只画笔忙起来。\n草地连在一起，\n中间还多了一条小路。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fd5bd845038ee568a78a4d69254b4080c53c9100c8881b3fc3f20af06c338655",
      "text": "悟空又给小熊画了个枕头。\n“画了这么久，\n你也该歇歇啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b5d13d7bf487ba853f2152e88868f73535e58a9c7de89d88fd09a7a45220d84f",
      "text": "洗好画笔，\n把画挂起来。\n大家越看越喜欢。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "94dfda1ea38715925c2ea6b8149336c1e7e121251e29320a5725f4063a4e58aa",
      "text": "悟空越看越高兴。\n“这可是咱们一起画的！\n小熊，晚安啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8e47bfd76283cf8f242247af1e2a096d7a4f84d95f25500387c8fb7d678be320",
